{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Shifter</strong> is a minimalist and atmospheric puzzle experience that will challenge your spatial reasoning and problem-solving skills. In this unique puzzle-box adventure, you control a shifting square that moves continuously in a chosen direction until it hits an obstacle. Your goal? Find the perfect path to the exit.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With <strong>60 handcrafted levels</strong> spread across <strong>six distinct zones</strong>, <i>Shifter</i> introduces a variety of mechanics that keep gameplay fresh and engaging. Navigate through teleporters, activate moving walls, avoid deadly spikes, and discover even more surprises along the way. Each zone presents new challenges, encouraging players to think ahead, experiment, and refine their strategy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3500660/extras/7855b610addca40ba9352e45f2eb82cc.poster.avif?t=1746616333\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3500660/extras/7855b610addca40ba9352e45f2eb82cc.webm?t=1746616333\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3500660/extras/7855b610addca40ba9352e45f2eb82cc.mp4?t=1746616333\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3500660/extras/f1f37ef58de8760384bcc525ee5635bd.avif?t=1746616333\" data-has-big width=800 height=222 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd39 <strong>Minimalist Aesthetic</strong> \u2013 A clean and atmospheric design that keeps the focus on the puzzles.<br>\ud83d\udd39 <strong>Unique Puzzle Mechanics</strong> \u2013 Master teleporters, shifting walls, spikes, and more.<br>\ud83d\udd39 <strong>60 Handcrafted Levels</strong> \u2013 A carefully curated difficulty curve with satisfying solutions.<br>\ud83d\udd39 <strong>Relaxing Yet Challenging</strong> \u2013 No timers, no pressure\u2014just pure puzzle-solving satisfaction.<br>\ud83d\udd39 <strong>Immersive Sound Design</strong> \u2013 A subtle, atmospheric soundtrack that enhances the experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you love clever puzzle games that require foresight and experimentation, <i>Shifter</i> will keep you thinking from start to finish. Can you find the right path through every level and escape the puzzle box?</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Completed Zone 1","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3500660/68326a13e2d07a700ee2bb6c9e80f24d561b40ea.jpg"},{"name":"Completed Zone 2","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3500660/c5549784720b173861af36f99f560b24a14969bd.jpg"},{"name":"Completed Zone 3","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3500660/025e623afec597af45196f0d07d93ca0dc812cb4.jpg"},{"name":"Completed Zone 4","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3500660/cbe21c3e2c789be934b55b39fa4251f2ffce7606.jpg"},{"name":"Completed Zone 5","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3500660/cfb55253a8d96b44fadb6cef4816d5da2751eac8.jpg"},{"name":"Completed Zone 6","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3500660/5ff6a06f79dc29569b31965375c970223b5e3721.jpg"},{"name":"Complete All Levels","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3500660/464c039d15c8948fabd3b488fa90e8125bd6816e.jpg"},{"name":"Perfect Zone 1","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3500660/8da934f8a7aeb1e0da4c589f50160829f9d9a032.jpg